# Root build context is used by infra/backup/Dockerfile so it can copy
# scripts/backup-mysql.sh and infra/backup/backup-loop.sh. Keep the context
# allowlisted to avoid sending local .env files, runtime DB data, node_modules,
# and other host-only artifacts to Docker or a remote builder.
**

!.dockerignore
!infra/
!infra/backup/
!infra/backup/Dockerfile
!infra/backup/backup-loop.sh
!scripts/
!scripts/backup-mysql.sh
